  "caption": "Brendan Allen choked out Christian Leroy Duncan late in round 5 to win the UFC Vegas 122 main event. 🔥\nBest finish: Fili or Tanzilovi? 👇\n\nThe rear-naked choke at 2:46 of the fifth made it four straight UFC wins for Allen. Jai Herbert outpointed Matheus Camilo in the co-main, and Andre Fili and Otari Tanzilovi both finished with head kicks. Allen, Fili, Tanzilovi and Alice Pereira each took home $100K bonuses.\n\nSwipe for the full UFC Vegas 122 results. Who's next for Allen?",
